        "body": "FreeBindCraft now supports native Apple Silicon Macs, with AlphaFold design and ProteinMPNN running on the Apple GPU through Metal. The unified installer sets up the pinned runtime, model weights, and native tools, with PyRosetta relaxation on the CPU by default or OpenMM/OpenCL GPU relaxation with `--no-pyrosetta`.\n\n- Includes small ubiquitin and PDL1 examples, bounded trajectory runs, and installation checks.\n- Tested on M2 and M5 Max Macs. Apple Silicon support is experimental.\n- Updates the Linux installer and Docker image to the pinned CUDA 12.9 stack, validated on an RTX 5090 without PyRosetta.\n- Streamlines setup documentation for both platforms.\n\nSee the [Apple Silicon guide](https://github.com/cytokineking/FreeBindCraft/blob/v1.0.6/APPLE_SILICON.md) for installation, examples, and tested performance.\n",
